{
  "schema_version": "v1",
  "description": "Strict enforcement mode denies. A PEP must treat each case as the expected verdict, never as an allow, and never as a PDP outage unless pdp_unavailable is true. Unknown future reasons are still denies.",
  "cases": [
    {
